OUR STRATEGIES
We have formulated the following strategies in line with our mission and vision:
. consolidate technological leadership and lead power transmission and distribution
equipment upgrades;
. accelerate innovation in emerging businesses to cultivate sustainable growth;
. drive global production capacity expansion with smart manufacturing to build a
world-class system;
.

